    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1617">

                <pb facs="1016" n="900" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg900"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811.0144.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul Garrett.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-01-27T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 27, 1914, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your January 26. In event Cantu not already killed and assuming the certainty of
                    the circumstances as stated by you that he was kidnapped on American side of
                    boundary, say to appropriate authorities that United States Government demands
                    his immediate release and return to American side of border.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
